---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM (SELECT a, b FROM t DISTRIBUTE BY CAST(b AS INT) SORT BY a) DISTRIBUTE BY a"
---
Repartition (a#0)
+- Sort [a#0 ASC NULLS FIRST], false
   +- Repartition (CAST(b#1 AS INT))
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
